    "Apply Layout Change To…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apply Layout Change To…"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "レイアウトの変更をどこまで適用しますか?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archives found inside the books open in this launch that had to be written out to be read — RAR and 7z only, since ZIP is read directly from memory. Only the ones in use are kept; they are removed as you move on, when the book is closed, and when the app quits." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archives found inside the books open in this launch that had to be written out to be read — RAR and 7z only, since ZIP is read directly from memory. Only the ones in use are kept; they are removed as you move on, when the book is closed, and when the app quits."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この起動で開いた本の中で見つかった書庫のうち、読むためにファイルへ書き出す必要があったものです ―― ZIP形式はメモリから直接読むため、RAR・7z形式だけが対象です。使っているぶんだけを残し、読み進めるにつれて・本を閉じたとき・アプリを終了したときに削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archives found inside this book that are open right now, against the “Nested archives kept in memory” setting. The count includes every format, but the size covers only ZIP archives — RAR and 7z have to be held as temporary files instead, which appear under On Disk ▸ Temporary files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archives found inside this book that are open right now, against the “Nested archives kept in memory” setting. The count includes every format, but the size covers only ZIP archives — RAR and 7z have to be held as temporary files instead, which appear under On Disk ▸ Temporary files."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この本の中で見つかった書庫のうち、いま開いているもの。分母は設定「メモリに残しておく入れ子の書庫」です。件数は形式を問わず数えますが、サイズはZIP形式のぶんだけです ―― RAR・7z形式は一時ファイルとして持つほかなく、そちらは「ディスク上」の「一時ファイル」に出ます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
