    "Memory not accounted for by the page-image and thumbnail caches of the book in this window. Includes the app itself, other open books, and anything waiting to be returned to the system. Shown as — when the system has compressed the caches below their nominal size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory not accounted for by the page-image and thumbnail caches of the book in this window. Includes the app itself, other open books, and anything waiting to be returned to the system. Shown as — when the system has compressed the caches below their nominal size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このウインドウの本のページ画像・サムネイルのキャッシュでは説明できないメモリです。アプリ本体、他に開いている本、システムへ返却待ちの領域を含みます。システムがキャッシュを名目上の大きさより小さく圧縮しているときは「—」になります。"
