      }
    },
    "One cell per page across the “Pages to preload on each side” range, laid out in reading order around the pages on screen (two cells in two-page spreads). Every cell filled means preloading is keeping up; a gap means that page is not in memory yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One cell per page across the “Pages to preload on each side” range, laid out in reading order around the pages on screen (two cells in two-page spreads). Every cell filled means preloading is keeping up; a gap means that page is not in memory yet."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "環境設定「前後に先読みするページ数」の範囲を、いま表示しているページ(見開きなら2マス)を挟んで1マス1ページで並べています。並びは読み方向に合わせてあります。すべてのマスが塗られていれば先読みは追いついています。欠けたマスは、そのページがまだメモリにありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only thumbnails are deleted. Your favorites, bookmarks, and reading history are not affected — pages are simply decoded again the next time you need them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only thumbnails are deleted. Your favorites, bookmarks, and reading history are not affected — pages are simply decoded again the next time you need them."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削除されるのはサムネイルだけです。\nお気に入り・ブックマーク・読書位置には影響しません。\n次に必要になった時点で、ページを読み込み直すだけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
