    "Reopening a book you have already viewed becomes much faster, especially from an external drive or a network volume. In exchange, qooViewer keeps thumbnail files on your startup disk. Turning this off deletes them right away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reopening a book you have already viewed becomes much faster, especially from an external drive or a network volume. In exchange, qooViewer keeps thumbnail files on your startup disk. Turning this off deletes them right away."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一度見た本を開き直すのが大幅に速くなります(特に外付けドライブやネットワークボリューム上の本)。\nそのぶん、サムネイルのファイルが起動ディスクに残ります。\nOFFにすると、残っているぶんは速やかに削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
