          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes every favorite, favorite folder, bookmark, page layout setting, and saved reading position (last page, display settings) for every book. This cannot be undone, and qooViewer will quit immediately afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This permanently deletes every favorite, favorite folder, bookmark, page layout setting, and saved reading position (last page, display settings) for every book. This cannot be undone, and qooViewer will quit immediately afterward."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのお気に入り・お気に入りフォルダ・ブックマーク・レイアウト設定、およびすべての本の保存済みの読書位置(最後に読んだページ・表示設定)を完全に削除します。この操作は取り消せません。実行後、qooViewerはただちに終了します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes every layout setting (reading direction, page order, single/spread page settings) in this book. This cannot be undone." : {
