    "When a book has other archives inside it, each one is opened only when you reach it, and the most recently used ones are kept here. Larger values move between chapters faster; smaller values use less memory and less temporary disk space. ZIP archives are kept in memory; RAR and 7z archives have to be written to a temporary file instead, and how much of that is kept follows this setting too. At 0, a temporary file is always used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a book has other archives inside it, each one is opened only when you reach it, and the most recently used ones are kept here. Larger values move between chapters faster; smaller values use less memory and less temporary disk space. ZIP archives are kept in memory; RAR and 7z archives have to be written to a temporary file instead, and how much of that is kept follows this setting too. At 0, a temporary file is always used."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本の中にさらに書庫が入っている場合、その書庫はそこまで読み進めたときに初めて開き、最近使ったものをここに残しておきます。大きくするほど章をまたぐ移動が速くなり、小さくするほどメモリと一時ディスクの使用量が減ります。ZIP形式はメモリに残せますが、RAR・7z形式は一時ファイルに書き出すほかなく、そちらをどれだけ残しておくかもこの設定に従います。0にすると常に一時ファイルを使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When scrolling is not possible — that is, in Fit to Screen — the wheel always performs the action assigned to it in Mouse, whatever you choose here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When scrolling is not possible — that is, in Fit to Screen — the wheel always performs the action assigned to it in Mouse, whatever you choose here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スクロールできないとき(「画面内に収める」で表示しているとき)は、ここでの選択に関わらず、「マウス」でホイールに割り当てた操作を行います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Scrolling Is Possible" : {
      "localizations" : {
